# TraceGuard AI

**AI-Powered Security Log Analyzer using LLM Tool Calling**

## Project Overview

TraceGuard AI is a web-based security log analysis application built using Python and Flask.

It uses a Large Language Model (LLM) with tool-calling capabilities to investigate security logs, identify suspicious activity, and generate understandable security reports.

## Development Approach

The project will be developed locally, tested, pushed to GitHub, and deployed after Version 1 is completed.

